# Build context for docker/coordinator.Dockerfile (audit DS41-072).
#
# The release gate builds from `git archive HEAD`, where none of this exists. A
# build run from a working tree, and above all on the coordinator host, where
# `.env`, `coordinator.toml` and the SQLite database are provisioned in place,
# would otherwise send them to the daemon and bake them into an image layer
# (NOSTRAUTICA_COORDINATOR_NSEC, VENICE_API_KEY, attendee PII). Deleting a file
# in a later layer does not remove it from the earlier one.

# Secrets and runtime state
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/coordinator.toml
**/local-test.toml
**/*.ncryptsec
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/*.sqlite.*
**/coordinator.out
**/RELEASE_ID

# Local build output and dependencies: the image installs and builds its own
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.svelte-kit
docs-site-build
.pnpm-store

# Not needed in the image
.git
.claude
**/*.log
e2e/test-results
